'{$STAMP BS2p} 

'{$PBASIC 2.5} 

KEY     VAR     Byte 
 
Main:     DO
 
SERIN 3,2063,250,Timeout,[KEY] 
If Key = B Then GOSUB Forward
If Key = A Then GOSUB Backward
If Key = C Then GOSUB SpinRight

	LOOP
 
 Timeout:  GOSUB Motor_OFF
 
    	   GOTO Main
  
 '+++++ Movement Procedure ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
HIGH  13 : LOW 12 : HIGH 15 : LOW 14 : RETURN
HIGH  12 : LOW 13 : HIGH 14 : LOW 15 : RETURN
HIGH 12 : LOW 13 : HIGH 15 : LOW 14 : RETURN
Motor_OFF: LOW   13 : LOW 12 : LOW  15 : LOW 14 : RETURN 

 '+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++ 
